        "text": "{\"recorded_count\": 23, \"total_count\": 23, \"missing_ids\": [], \"complete\": true, \"results\": [{\"item_id\": \"FT-1\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created listing with photo, title \\\"QA Vintage Table Lamp\\\", description, price $42.5, category Home Decor, condition Good, location Seattle WA, and upcycled toggled on. Product detail page displays all these values correctly, plus Upcycled badge and seller info.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-2\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No edit functionality for existing listings\", \"actual\": \"The My Listings page only exposes \\\"View\\\", \\\"Mark Sold\\\", and \\\"Delete\\\" actions per listing card; there is no \\\"Edit\\\" button or any UI path to modify an existing listing's title, description, photos, price, category, condition, location, or upcycled status. The product detail page (owner view) likewise only offers a \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" link, no edit option.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-3\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Mark Sold changed status badge to \\\"Sold\\\" and button to \\\"Mark Available\\\" immediately; toggling back restored \\\"Active\\\"/\\\"Mark Sold\\\". Delete showed a confirmation dialog (\\\"Delete listing? This action cannot be undone\\\"); confirming removed the listing immediately from My Listings with \\\"Listing deleted\\\" toast.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-4\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After marking \\\"Mid-Century Modern Armchair\\\" as Sold, Browse All Items count dropped from 10 to 9 and the item no longer appears in the browse grid; there is no remaining UI path (browse, search, or category) to reach the sold item to add it to cart or start a purchase request. Earlier, the deleted \\\"QA Vintage Table Lamp\\\" listing also does not reappear anywhere in browse results.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered qatester1@example.com with name, password, location; got \\\"Account created successfully!\\\" toast and header shows signed-in user \\\"QA Tester\\\" with Sell button.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Combined Upcycled-only + Furniture category filters -> 3/10 items (Bookshelf, Coffee Table, Armchair, all Furniture+Upcycled). Adding Condition=Like New further narrowed to 1 item (Armchair, the only Furniture+Upcycled+Like New listing) - every result satisfied all active criteria. Sort \\\"Price: Low to High\\\" reordered the 3-item filtered set to $175, $285, $320 ascending while filter results (count=3) remained intact.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search \\\"denim\\\"/\\\"DENIM\\\" both matched title \\\"Vintage Denim Jacket\\\" (case-insensitive), \\\"Brooklyn\\\" matched 2 items by location text, \\\"fading\\\" matched 1 item by description text. Clearing search restored all 10 items.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Added \\\"Yoga Mat & Blocks Set\\\" ($55, Sofia Martinez's listing) to cart while signed in as Emma (non-owner). Cart page shows the item with title, photo, location \\\"Austin, TX\\\", price $55, and correct total $55.00.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On \\\"Vintage Denim Jacket - Size M\\\" (owned by Marcus Chen, not Emma), clicked \\\"Message Seller\\\", typed a non-empty message, \\\"Send Message\\\" became enabled, and clicking it produced a \\\"Message sent to seller!\\\" confirmation toast.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category browsing page does not filter results by chosen category\", \"actual\": \"On /categories, \\\"Furniture\\\" tile correctly displayed \\\"3 items\\\". Clicking it navigated to /?category=furniture, but the Browse page ignored the category query param: it showed \\\"10 items available\\\" (all listings, including Clothing, Electronics, Books, etc.) and the \\\"Furniture\\\" checkbox in the Filters sidebar remained unchecked. Expected: browse results should show only the 3 available Furniture listings with a matching result count.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No seller inbox to view purchase requests/messages\", \"actual\": \"After a buyer (Emma) sent a purchase request via cart (\\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\") and a direct message via \\\"Message Seller\\\" (\\\"Message sent to seller!\\\"), there is no UI anywhere for the seller to view the requested item or buyer message: the header has no notifications/messages icon (only search and mobile-menu icons), the user dropdown only offers \\\"My Profile\\\" (which 404s), \\\"My Listings\\\", and \\\"Log out\\\", and My Listings shows no request/message indicator per listing.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Login with unregistered email nonexistent_user_xyz@example.com shows \\\"Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com\\\" toast, stays on /login, header remains unauthenticated.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Duplicate email registration not rejected\", \"actual\": \"Registering with the exact same email (qatester1@example.com) and with a case-only variation (QATester1@example.com) as an already-registered account both succeeded with \\\"Account created successfully!\\\" and signed the user in as a new/different account, instead of being rejected.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Incorrect password accepted for demo accounts\", \"actual\": \"Login with emma@example.com and an incorrect password (\\\"definitely_wrong_password_123\\\") succeeded, showing \\\"Welcome back!\\\" and authenticating as \\\"Emma Green\\\". Login page itself even discloses \\\"(any password works)\\\" for demo accounts, confirming password is not verified for these registered accounts.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Viewing \\\"Yoga Mat & Blocks Set\\\" (owned by seller Sofia Martinez) while signed in as Emma Green shows only \\\"Add to Cart\\\" and \\\"Message Seller\\\" buyer actions — no Manage/Edit/Delete/Mark Sold seller-management controls. Conversely, viewing Emma's own listing earlier showed a \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" link instead of buyer actions.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting with no photo shows toast \\\"Please add at least one image\\\". Submitting with empty title/description/price triggers native HTML5 required-field validation (tooltip \\\"Please fill out this field.\\\") preventing submission. No listing created in either case.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price field is a number input with min=0; entering -5 blocks submission with native validation \\\"Value must be greater than or equal to 0.\\\" and no listing is created. Non-numeric text (\\\"abc\\\") cannot even be entered into the field (browser rejects it), preventing non-numeric prices entirely.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Logged out: clicking \\\"Add to Cart\\\" on a product page redirected to /login and showed toast \\\"Please log in to add items to your cart\\\". Header while logged out has no \\\"Sell\\\" button (create-listing entry point hidden), and direct navigation to /sell returns 404 (route not reachable without auth context).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No duplicate-account feedback shown\", \"actual\": \"Attempting to register with an already-used email (exact and case-variant) shows a success toast \\\"Account created successfully!\\\" and navigates away from the registration form instead of showing duplicate-account error feedback.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing into search box updated result count and listing grid immediately without pressing Enter or clicking a submit button (e.g. \\\"10 items available\\\" -> \\\"1 items available\\\" instantly after typing \\\"denim\\\").\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each filter checkbox click (Upcycled, Furniture, Like New) and sort dropdown change immediately updated the listing grid and \\\"X items available\\\" count with no separate submit action. \\\"Clear all filters\\\" button appeared once any filter was active.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking \\\"Add to Cart\\\" immediately showed a \\\"Added to cart!\\\" toast and the header cart icon updated to show count \\\"1\\\" without reload; navigating to /cart (via icon click) shows the line item and $55.00 total already reflected.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Product detail pages (prod-10, prod-1) consistently display: photo(s) with prev/next controls, title, description, price, category breadcrumb/badge, condition badge, location with distance, seller name+location, \\\"Listed <date>\\\", and upcycled badge when applicable. All values matched the corresponding listing/browse-card data (e.g. Mid-Century Modern Armchair: Furniture, Like New, $285, Brooklyn NY, Emma Green, Listed 2024-11-20). Availability status is also shown: after marking the Armchair \\\"Sold\\\" via My Listings, its detail page displayed explicit text \\\"This item is no longer available\\\" and hid the Add to Cart/Message Seller buttons, confirming availability state is reflected on the detail page.\"}]}"
